#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:2
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Plugins"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| is extendable with custom plugins for Task types, UI tabs, "
"reports, approvals, cypher, and more. Plugins are added from the Plugins "
"tab of the Integration page under Administration (|AdmIntPlu|). Simply "
"browse for a local plugin file (.jar) to add it to the UI. Custom plugins"
" can also be edited or deleted by clicking on the pencil or trash can "
"icons in the corresponding row."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| es extendable con personalizado plugins para Tarea tipos, UI "
"tabs, reports, approvals, cypher, y más. Plugins son agregado desde el "
"Plugins pestaña de el Integración página under Administración "
"(|AdmIntPlu|). Simply browse para a local plugin file (.jar) a agregar "
"ello a el UI. Personalizado plugins puede también be edited o deleted por"
" clicking en el pencil o trash puede icons en el corresponding row."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| maintains a repository of internally-developed and vetted "
"plugins at |morpheus| `Exchange <https://share.morpheusdata.com/>`_. "
"These plugins can be downloaded and added to |morpheus| using the "
"instructions in the prior paragraph. Alongside the download link, you can"
" also find helpful readme information that discusses how the plugin can "
"be used and which versions of |morpheus| it's compatible with."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| maintains a repository de internally-developed y vetted "
"plugins en |morpheus| `Exchange <https://share.morpheusdata.com/>`_. "
"Estos plugins puede ser downloaded y agregado a |morpheus| usando el "
"instructions en el prior paragraph. Alongside el download link, usted "
"puede también find helpful readme information ese discusses how el plugin"
" puede ser usado y que versions de |morpheus| ello's compatible con."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:12
msgid "Marketplace Search"
msgstr "Búsqueda en Marketplace"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:14
msgid ""
"The Plugins page includes an integrated search interface for browsing the"
" |morpheus| Exchange marketplace directly from the UI. Plugins listed in "
"the marketplace are automatically filtered to show only those compatible "
"with the current appliance version, eliminating the risk of installing "
"incompatible plugins."
msgstr "La página Plugins incluye una interfaz de búsqueda integrada para explorar el marketplace Exchange de |morpheus| directamente desde la UI. Los plugins listados en el marketplace se filtran automáticamente para mostrar solo los compatibles con la versión actual del dispositivo, eliminando el riesgo de instalar plugins incompatibles."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:16
msgid "From the Plugins page, use the marketplace search to:"
msgstr "Desde la página Plugins, use la búsqueda del marketplace para:"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:18
msgid "Browse available plugins by name or description"
msgstr "Explorar plugins disponibles por nombre o descripción"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:19
msgid "View plugin details including version, compatibility, and description"
msgstr "Ver detalles del plugin, incluida la versión, compatibilidad y descripción"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:20
msgid "Download compatible plugins directly for installation"
msgstr "Descargar plugins compatibles directamente para su instalación"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:22
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:24
msgid ""
"The appliance must have outbound HTTPS access to "
"``share.morpheusdata.com`` (port 443). Environments with restricted "
"outbound access must configure a proxy or allowlist this endpoint. If the"
" marketplace is unreachable, the search returns a connection error but "
"local plugin management remains unaffected."
msgstr "El dispositivo debe tener acceso HTTPS saliente a ``share.morpheusdata.com`` (puerto 443). Los entornos con acceso saliente restringido deben configurar un proxy o incluir este endpoint en la lista de permitidos. Si el marketplace no es accesible, la búsqueda devuelve un error de conexión, pero la administración local de plugins no se ve afectada."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:26
msgid ""
"With at least one plugin integrated, |morpheus| will show details on each"
" plugin from the Plugins List View. The following information is "
"displayed:"
msgstr ""
"Con en least uno plugin integrated, |morpheus| va a show detalles en cada"
" plugin desde el Plugins Lista View. Lo siguiente information es "
"mostrado:"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:28
msgid "**NAME:** The name given to the plugin"
msgstr "**NAME:** El nombre given a el plugin"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:29
msgid "**DESCRIPTION:** A description value (if any) coded into the plugin"
msgstr "**DESCRIPTION:** Un description valor (si cualquier) coded en el plugin"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:30
msgid "**FILE NAME:** The .jar filename"
msgstr "**FILE NAME:** El .jar filename"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:31
msgid "**VERSION:** The plugin version number"
msgstr "**VERSION:** El plugin version número"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:32
msgid ""
"**STATUS:** The status of the plugin, such as \"loaded\" when the plugin "
"is ready for use"
msgstr ""
"**STATUS:** El status de el plugin, como \"loaded\" cuando el plugin es "
"ready para usar"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:33
msgid "**STATUS MESSAGE:** A status message (if any) for the plugin"
msgstr "**STATUS MESSAGE:** Un status message (si cualquier) para el plugin"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:34
msgid ""
"**ENABLED:** If the plugin is enabled, a check mark appears here. "
"Disabled plugins are also grayed out"
msgstr ""
"**ENABLED:** Si el plugin está habilitado, a check mark appears here. "
"Deshabilitado plugins son también grayed out"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:36
msgid ""
"Additional information about each plugin can be viewed by clicking on the"
" pencil (edit) icon. Most of the information in this modal is read-only "
"but you can enable or disable plugins from this pane."
msgstr ""
"Additional information acerca de cada plugin puede ser viewed por "
"clicking en el pencil (editar) icon. La mayoría de de el information en "
"este modal es read-solo pero usted puede enable o disable plugins desde "
"este pane."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:38
msgid ""
"Please visit the `Morpheus Developer Portal "
"<https://developer.morpheusdata.com>`_ for Plugin Architecture SDK "
"documentation and help getting started with custom Plugin development."
msgstr ""
"Please visit el `Morpheus Desarrollador Portal "
"<https://desarrollador.morpheusdata.com>`_ para Plugin Architecture SDK "
"documentation y help getting started con personalizado Plugin "
"development."

